  "prompt": "The quadratic function\n[Figure 1]\nis defined by\n[Figure 2]\n, where\n[Figure 3]\nis a positive constant. The graph of\n[Figure 4]\nin the\n[Figure 5]\n-plane has\n[Figure 6]\n-intercepts at\n[Figure 7]\nand\n[Figure 8]\n, where\n[Figure 9]\nis a positive constant. If\n[Figure 10]\n, what is the value of\n[Figure 11]\n?",
